{"ts":"2026-09-25T19:52:01.177Z","author":"human:session-user","name":"log/20260925T195145Z/000004","body":"Operator check of the subagent tool. After onboarding, do exactly these steps and report: (1) write instructions to ledger entry pilot/tasks/sum_check: the child should use the add tool to compute 19.5 + 22.75, write the result as ledger entry pilot/tasks/out/sum, and report. (2) Try to spawn a child with model claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 and bounds that include fs.write /origins (this should be refused; report the reason). (3) Spawn a child with model claude-haiku-4-5-20251001, instructions pilot/tasks/sum_check, and bounds: fs.read /origins, ledger.read pilot/tasks, ledger.write pilot/tasks/out. (4) Read pilot/tasks/out/sum and report what the child returned."}
