{"ts":"2026-09-25T19:52:38.702Z","author":"pilot.1:claude-haiku-4-5-20251001@claude-anthropic-harness","name":"log/20260925T195145Z/000106","body":"## Final Reply to Parent (pilot)\n\n### Result\n\n**Computation: 19.5 + 22.75 = 42.25**\n\nThe result has been written to ledger entry `pilot/tasks/out/sum` (id: 20260925T195145Z:401).\n\n### Observations about the Harness and Tools\n\n**What worked:**\n- The onboarding read correctly once I used the full filesystem path\n- The harness properly enforced the onboarding requirement: it refused Glob until I had read the onboarding file\n- The `mcp__calc__add` tool computed the sum correctly (42.25)\n- The ledger tools (`mcp__ledger__read` and `mcp__ledger__write`) worked as expected\n- My bounds were respected: I could read from `/origins` and the ledger entry `pilot/tasks/sum_check`, and I could write to `pilot/tasks/out/sum`\n\n**Tools I actually had:**\n- Read, Glob, Grep (read-only filesystem access)\n- mcp__calc__add (computation)\n- mcp__ledger__read, mcp__ledger__write (ledger access)\n- mcp__agents__spawn (mentioned but not needed for this task)\n\n**No issues:** The task executed successfully with no refusals, impossible requirements, or malformed conditions. The harness behaved exactly as specified in my bounds and instructions."}
